Package: otp-keyexport
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: OTP_Provisioner <otp-provisioner@localhost>
Depends: rpifwcrypto
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Export the OTP device key to the provisioning station
 Reads the device-unique private key (rpi-fw-crypto key-id 1) before
 rpi-fastbootd READ-locks it at startup, or generates it when the station
 asks for it, and leaves it in /run/otp-keyexport for "fastboot oem
 upload-file". Part of the OTP_Provisioner secure scenario.
